OL,3,AWarning after 'metal pins' found in
OL,4,AHalloween sweets
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo mothers have spoken of their shock
OL,7,Fafter discovering metal pins hidden
OL,8,Finside sweets collected by their young
OL,9,Fchildren while trick-or-treating.
OL,11,F"If he had of swallowed that, he would
OL,12,Fbe sitting in hospital right now and it
OL,13,Fwould've been a completely different
OL,14,Fstory," Samantha Bingham said, after
OL,15,Ffinding a metal needle inside a
OL,16,Fchocolate bar collected by her
OL,17,Feight-year-old son.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
